  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Fresh_Pasta?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/93/Fresh_Pasta.png/revision/latest?cb=20240211172634\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Fresh pasta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fresh pasta\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Fresh pasta</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Product</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 67</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 1 to 43</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  15 min</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Pasta Maker</span><span title=\"Pasta maker\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/pasta-maker-19438\" title=\"Pasta Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pasta Maker\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Default: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 12</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 2</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">★★★</a> </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">12 min</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Fresh pasta</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">product</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 67.\n</p><p>It is used to make <a href=\"/wiki/broccoli-pasta-30755\" title=\"Broccoli Pasta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">broccoli pasta</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/lobster-pasta-20285\" title=\"Lobster Pasta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lobster pasta</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/pasta-salad-19454\" title=\"Pasta Salad\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pasta salad</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/veggie-lasagna-20284\" title=\"Veggie Lasagna\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">veggie lasagna</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/pasta-carbonara-28427\" title=\"Pasta Carbonara\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pasta carbonara</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/spicy-pasta-29374\" title=\"Spicy Pasta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">spicy pasta</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/mushroom-pasta-31953\" title=\"Mushroom Pasta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mushroom pasta</a>.\n</p><p>Like all <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>, it is stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Making fresh pasta</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/38/Pasta_Maker.png/revision/latest?cb=20250925211526\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Pasta Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pasta Maker\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Pasta Maker</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Fresh pasta is made in the <a href=\"/wiki/pasta-maker-19438\" title=\"Pasta Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pasta Maker</a>.\n</p><p>To make fresh pasta, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/egg-2058\" title=\"Egg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Egg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/wheat-2062\" title=\"Wheat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Wheat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x2</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 15 minutes to make one unit, and only 12 minutes in a fully <a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mastered</a> maker. Each unit gives players 5 <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Selling fresh pasta</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/09/Roadside_Shop.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028143054\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Roadside Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Roadside Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Roadside Shop</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li>Fresh pasta can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 432 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> for 10 units.</li>\n<li>Buying the ingredients required to make fresh pasta costs 24 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Using fresh pasta</b></span></h3>\n<p>Fresh pasta is used to make the following <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>:\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/pasta-salad-19454\" title=\"Pasta salad\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pasta salad\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/veggie-lasagna-20284\" title=\"Veggie lasagna\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Veggie lasagna\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/lobster-pasta-20285\" title=\"Lobster pasta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lobster pasta\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/pasta-salad-19454\" title=\"Pasta Salad\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pasta Salad</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/veggie-lasagna-20284\" title=\"Veggie Lasagna\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Veggie Lasagna</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/lobster-pasta-20285\" title=\"Lobster Pasta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lobster Pasta</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/93/Fresh_Pasta.png/revision/latest?cb=20240211172634\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fresh Pasta\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x4</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/93/Fresh_Pasta.png/revision/latest?cb=20240211172634\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fresh Pasta\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x3</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/93/Fresh_Pasta.png/revision/latest?cb=20240211172634\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fresh Pasta\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x3</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 67\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 74\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 79\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/pasta-carbonara-28427\" title=\"Pasta carbonara\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pasta carbonara\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/broccoli-pasta-30755\" title=\"Broccoli pasta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Broccoli pasta\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/spicy-pasta-29374\" title=\"Spicy pasta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Spicy pasta\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/pasta-carbonara-28427\" title=\"Pasta Carbonara\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pasta Carbonara</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/broccoli-pasta-30755\" title=\"Broccoli Pasta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Broccoli Pasta</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/spicy-pasta-29374\" title=\"Spicy Pasta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Spicy Pasta</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/93/Fresh_Pasta.png/revision/latest?cb=20240211172634\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fresh Pasta\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x3</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/93/Fresh_Pasta.png/revision/latest?cb=20240211172634\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fresh Pasta\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x3</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/93/Fresh_Pasta.png/revision/latest?cb=20240211172634\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fresh Pasta\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x3</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 83\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 83\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 87\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/mushroom-pasta-31953\" title=\"Mushroom pasta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mushroom pasta\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/mushroom-pasta-31953\" title=\"Mushroom Pasta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Mushroom Pasta</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/93/Fresh_Pasta.png/revision/latest?cb=20240211172634\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fresh Pasta\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x3</b>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 101\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Boat orders</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Riverboat.png/revision/latest?cb=20150712182459\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Riverboat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Riverboat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Riverboat</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boat</a> orders ask for 8 to 12 units of fresh pasta per crate, up to a total of 48 units per boat.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Although fresh pasta can occasionally be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/daily-dirt-2679\" title=\"Daily Dirt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Daily Dirt</a> you shouldn't expect to be able to get it there, especially since it is needed in big quantities to make dishes and fill boat crates.</li>\n<li>Since Fresh Pasta has the most amount of uses of a product&#160;that requires <a href=\"/wiki/egg-2058\" title=\"Egg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">eggs</a>, if you're making a lot of pasta dishes, it's a good idea to stock up on eggs.\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/mayonnaise-8931\" title=\"Mayonnaise\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Mayonnaise</a> is another product that requires a lot of eggs, but since most recipes only require one, and&#160;there's less products that require it, it's best to use your eggs toward Fresh Pasta.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<hr>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-pasta-maker-products-19452\" title=\"Category:Pasta Maker Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pasta Maker Products</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/fresh-pasta-19449\" title=\"Fresh Pasta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fresh Pasta\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/rice-noodles-19451\" title=\"Rice Noodles\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Rice Noodles\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Products</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831160948\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.119 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.159 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 921/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9086/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 466/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 7/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.014/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1035408/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   87.080      1 -total\n 70.68%   61.552      1 Template:Infobox\n 31.11%   27.090      9 Template:Infoicon\n 15.53%   13.523      1 Template:Navigation\n  8.16%    7.108      1 Template:PastaMakerMenu\n  5.46%    4.755      1 Template:Item_Usage\n  2.05%    1.787      1 Template:PageDisplay\n  2.05%    1.783      1 Template:Languages\n  1.76%    1.535      4 Template:Clr\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:19449-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260831160948 and revision id 107283. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
